[{"state": "SMS log, booking ref TR-5521. Yara Nakamura 09:02: Kindly rebook us onto flight KQ418, 3 passengers at 210 EUR each. Agent 09:10: Confirmed, total 630 EUR. Yara Nakamura 09:14: Correction, please remove my brother; only 2 will travel. Agent 09:20: Noted. Amended total applied, fare difference refunded to original card.", "questions": [
